---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms and privacy">
  <main id="main" class="page-shell prose-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">
      ← Home
    </a>
    <h1>Terms and privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Novels are available for personal reading without registration. Rights to works and covers remain with their rights holders. Reading a work on this site does not grant permission to republish it or use it commercially.
    </p>
    <h2>Library and reading data</h2>
    <p>Shelves, settings, and reading progress are stored in your browser and do not sync across devices. Personal ratings and news reactions are also saved locally and are not public votes.</p>
    <p>Clearing site data removes your saved reading progress. If browser storage is blocked, some settings last only until you close the page. Registering or signing in does not enable library sync.</p>
    <h2>Reader account</h2>
    <p>Registration is optional and uses an email address and password. Supabase Auth processes your email and sign-in information. Passwords are not stored in site files; session data is stored in your browser. Sign out when you finish using a shared computer.</p>
    <p>Your nickname, bio, and avatar color are saved in your Supabase Auth account. They are currently visible only in your profile; there are no public reader profiles. Nicknames are not unique sign-in names and do not affect access permissions. Reading settings are saved separately on this device.</p>
    <h2>Errors and content rights</h2>
    <p>Available contact methods are listed on the <a href="/contacts/">Contact page</a>. For questions about authorship, permissions, or removal, see our <a href="/rights/">information for rights holders</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
